---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Shipping & Delivery - FableTech Group" description="FableTech Group shipping and delivery policy. Learn about our logistics, delivery times, and shipping costs for B2B orders." locale="en">
  <div class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Shipping & Delivery Policy</h1>
      
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Shipping Methods</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          FableTech Group offers multiple shipping options to meet your business needs:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Express Shipping (3-7 days)</strong> - For urgent orders with door-to-door delivery</li>
          <li><strong>Standard Shipping (15-30 days)</strong> - Cost-effective option for regular orders</li>
          <li><strong>Air Freight (7-15 days)</strong> - For large volume orders requiring faster transit</li>
          <li><strong>Sea Freight (30-45 days)</strong> - Most economical for container shipments</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Delivery Times</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          Delivery times vary based on destination country, shipping method, and order volume. 
          Standard production lead time is 7-14 business days after order confirmation.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Shipping Costs</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          Shipping costs are calculated based on:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Order weight and dimensions</li>
          <li>Destination country and port</li>
          <li>Shipping method selected</li>
          <li>Volume discounts available for large orders</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Tracking & Insurance</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          All shipments include tracking numbers and cargo insurance. We partner with leading 
          logistics providers including DHL, FedEx, UPS, and Maersk to ensure safe and timely delivery.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Customs & Duties</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          Import duties, taxes, and customs clearance fees are the responsibility of the buyer. 
          We provide all necessary documentation including Commercial Invoice, Packing List, 
          and Certificate of Origin to facilitate customs clearance.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Special Requirements</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          For special shipping requirements such as hazardous materials handling, temperature-controlled 
          transport, or priority handling, please contact our logistics team at 
          <a href="mailto:logistics@fabletech.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">logistics@fabletech.com</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 mt-8">
          <p class="text-blue-800">
            <strong>Need a shipping quote?</strong> Contact our sales team with your order details 
            for a customized shipping solution.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
